<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A7.SS4" title="In Appendix G Prompts ‣ Autoformalizer with Tool Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.4 </span>System Prompt For ATF Inference</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
