<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The specific hyperparameter settings for ATF training are listed in <a href="#A2.T6" title="In Appendix B Hyperparameter of Training ‣ Autoformalizer with Tool Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
