<span id="A6.p1.pic1.2.27" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p1.pic1.2.27.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">(<span id="A6.p1.pic1.2.27.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Inconsistent.</span> The formalization’s logical structure is incorrect. It presents the existence of the board as a conditional derivation rather than as a given precondition. This changes the logical structure of the problem, making the formalization incorrect.)

