-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx126.26" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">:=</span><span id="lstnumberx126.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx126.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">by</span><span id="lstnumberx126.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx126.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">sorry</span>
</span>
</span>
<span id="A6.p1.pic1.2.32" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p1.pic1.2.32.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">(<span id="A6.p1.pic1.2.32.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Inconsistent.</span> ”Each person drinks tea with 56 people” is incorrectly formalized as ”Each person drinks tea with 1 person.”)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
