47.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">changed</span><span id="lstnumberx147.18" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"</span>
</span>
